    {"page": 2, "what": "Mace and Hammer are two lines, both our Club, Mace or Hammer, shown as Mace and Hammer. List prices as printed: Hunting Arrows 30 gc (ours 25), Forest Cloak 45 gc (the PDF's own entry, p4, and ours: 50 gc, Rare 10)."},
